\par
\par
12. GOVERNING LAW; VENUE\par
\par
This Agreement is governed by the laws of the State of Colorado,\par
without regard to conflict of law rules. Any action arising under this\par
Agreement will be brought in the state or federal courts located in\par
Denver County, Colorado.\par
\par
\par
13. NOTICES\par
\par
Notices under this Agreement must be in writing and delivered by email\par
with confirmation of receipt, or by mail, to the addresses stated on\par
the signature page or an applicable Order Form.\par
\par
\par
14. ENTIRE AGREEMENT\par
\par
This Agreement and its Order Forms are the entire agreement between the\par
parties concerning their subject matter and supersede prior discussions\par
and proposals. This Agreement may be amended only in a writing signed\par
by both parties.\par
